Description: Implements extended generalized monotone incremental forward
    stagewise regression as a modular R/Rcpp/C++ solution-path framework.
    The stagewise engine is separated from interchangeable family, link, fused
    family-link, and information-criterion modules. Built-in components support
    negative-binomial and Poisson regression, while custom modules can be
    supplied as built-in C++, live-compiled C++, or R callbacks.
